    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/4c54e16948a01509ed28b15334ef3951.poster.avif?t=1687983313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/4c54e16948a01509ed28b15334ef3951.webm?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/4c54e16948a01509ed28b15334ef3951.mp4?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>You are transported to a strange world where men are slaves and biologically weaker than women.<br>The world is ruled by seven powerful super heroes each with unique powers to help them rule with an iron fist.<br>With the help of your new found friends you take up the mantle to become the most dangerous vigilante the city has ever seen. </i><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/61fb6e1dfa0c358cee96dc801ea187bc.avif?t=1687983313\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/e2ee979f420d1de606bdd3fd9d95f7f3.poster.avif?t=1687983313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/e2ee979f420d1de606bdd3fd9d95f7f3.webm?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/e2ee979f420d1de606bdd3fd9d95f7f3.mp4?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Never Meet Your Heroes is a choice-driven adult RPG.<br><br><br>By day.. explore the large city of Massia solving any problems that may come your way. <br>Study at the university and take a shot at the slave test to win your freedom or discover deadly secrets that have plagued the city for years.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/8bf4e7523485995fbad2f1dc02798322.avif?t=1687983313\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/56f51d08865aa12974161c85633fab9f.poster.avif?t=1687983313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/56f51d08865aa12974161c85633fab9f.webm?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/56f51d08865aa12974161c85633fab9f.mp4?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>By night take on the mantle of the city's newest vigilante. Enhanced with a powerful serum which makes your body reach the peak of human capability... you now have a fighting chance against the heroes.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/a91758ada530e81f9dac3bce673079d0.avif?t=1687983313\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/8805367f77f39b84336d5ebb00f1364a.poster.avif?t=1687983313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/8805367f77f39b84336d5ebb00f1364a.webm?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/8805367f77f39b84336d5ebb00f1364a.mp4?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>When you aren't raiding criminal bases or taking down evil heroes you can choose to spend your time with many women of your choice. <br><br>Be sure to not let them get too close and give away your secret identity, or perhaps you trust them enough to reveal it yourself?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/5b7b1151a126dc7ef65ed2e911b634a2.poster.avif?t=1687983313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/5b7b1151a126dc7ef65ed2e911b634a2.webm?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/5b7b1151a126dc7ef65ed2e911b634a2.mp4?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Enjoy hundreds of personal first person animations.<br><br>It's time to equip your suit and jump into the new world.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/4c54e16948a01509ed28b15334ef3951.poster.avif?t=1687983313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/4c54e16948a01509ed28b15334ef3951.webm?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/4c54e16948a01509ed28b15334ef3951.mp4?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>You are transported to a strange world where men are slaves and biologically weaker than women.<br>The world is ruled by seven powerful super heroes each with unique powers to help them rule with an iron fist.<br>With the help of your new found friends you take up the mantle to become the most dangerous vigilante the city has ever seen. </i><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/61fb6e1dfa0c358cee96dc801ea187bc.avif?t=1687983313\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/e2ee979f420d1de606bdd3fd9d95f7f3.poster.avif?t=1687983313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/e2ee979f420d1de606bdd3fd9d95f7f3.webm?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/e2ee979f420d1de606bdd3fd9d95f7f3.mp4?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Never Meet Your Heroes is a choice-driven adult RPG.<br><br><br>By day.. explore the large city of Massia solving any problems that may come your way. <br>Study at the university and take a shot at the slave test to win your freedom or discover deadly secrets that have plagued the city for years.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/8bf4e7523485995fbad2f1dc02798322.avif?t=1687983313\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/56f51d08865aa12974161c85633fab9f.poster.avif?t=1687983313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/56f51d08865aa12974161c85633fab9f.webm?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/56f51d08865aa12974161c85633fab9f.mp4?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>By night take on the mantle of the city's newest vigilante. Enhanced with a powerful serum which makes your body reach the peak of human capability... you now have a fighting chance against the heroes.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/a91758ada530e81f9dac3bce673079d0.avif?t=1687983313\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/8805367f77f39b84336d5ebb00f1364a.poster.avif?t=1687983313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/8805367f77f39b84336d5ebb00f1364a.webm?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/8805367f77f39b84336d5ebb00f1364a.mp4?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>When you aren't raiding criminal bases or taking down evil heroes you can choose to spend your time with many women of your choice. <br><br>Be sure to not let them get too close and give away your secret identity, or perhaps you trust them enough to reveal it yourself?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/5b7b1151a126dc7ef65ed2e911b634a2.poster.avif?t=1687983313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/5b7b1151a126dc7ef65ed2e911b634a2.webm?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384240/extras/5b7b1151a126dc7ef65ed2e911b634a2.mp4?t=1687983313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Enjoy hundreds of personal first person animations.<br><br>It's time to equip your suit and jump into the new world.",
